OL,3,GNEWSARetired burglar 'cannot cope on
OL,4,Athe streets'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA burglar who claimed he had retired
OL,7,Fcommitted further crimes because he
OL,8,Fcould not cope outside prison, his
OL,9,Flawyer told a court.
OL,11,FNathan Stewart's defence solicitor said
OL,12,Fhe "deliberately carried out" two
OL,13,Foffences in Brampton in September,
OL,14,Fwhich involved making off without
OL,15,Fpayment and going equipped for
OL,16,Fburglary, "in order to be recalled to
OL,17,Fprison".
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
