OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSARetired burglar 'cannot cope on
OL,4,Athe streets'
OL,5,
OL,6,FLawyer Duncan Campbell said Stewart,
OL,7,Fwho was jailed in 2024 for raiding
OL,8,Fhomes in Carlisle and Penrith, had
OL,9,Freturned to crime last month as a "cry
OL,10,Ffor help" because he "cannot cope on
OL,11,Fthe streets very well".
OL,13,FDistrict Judge Philip Holden imposed a
OL,14,F12-month prison sentence, which will
OL,15,Frun concurrently alongside Stewart's
OL,16,Fprison licence term.
